.TH ARC 1 "October 2026" "FreeArc 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
arc \- FreeArc high-compression archive manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B arc
\fIcommand\fR [\fIoptions\fR] \fIarchive\fR[\fI.arc\fR] [\fIfiles...\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B arc
is a modern native C/C++ implementation of the FreeArc archiver. It provides
high compression ratios through advanced algorithms (LZMA, PPMD, GRZip, Tornado,
TTA) combined with intelligent preprocessors (REP, DICT, DELTA, BCJ/EXE, MM).
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B a
Add files to archive (default).
.TP
.B u
Update newer files and add new files.
.TP
.B f
Freshen existing files in archive (no new files added).
.TP
.B d
Delete files or patterns from archive.
.TP
.B m
Move files to archive (delete from disk after archiving).
.TP
.B l
Display archive file listing.
.TP
.B v
Display verbose archive file listing with Unix attributes and CRCs.
.TP
.B t
Test archive integrity.
.TP
.B e
Extract files without pathnames.
.TP
.B x
Extract files with pathnames.
.TP
.B p
Extract files to standard output (pipe).
.TP
.B s
Convert an existing archive to a standalone self-extracting executable (SFX).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-m \ METHOD
Select compression method or level (e.g. \fBstoring\fR, \fBlzma\fR, \fBtor\fR, \fBppmd\fR, \fBgrzip\fR, \fBtta\fR, \fB-m0\fR..\fB-m5\fR, \fB-mx\fR).
.TP
.B \-sfx\fR[\fB=\fISTUB\fR]
Create a standalone self-extracting executable (.sfx or .run).
.TP
.B \-s\fR, \fB\-s-
Create solid archive (default) or non-solid archive.
.TP
.B \-r\fR, \fB\-r-
Recurse subdirectories (default) or disable recursion.
.TP
.BI \-p \ PASS
Encrypt archive data blocks using password.
.TP
.BI \-hp \ PASS
Encrypt archive headers and data using password.
.TP
.BI \-ae \ ALG
Encryption algorithm: \fBaes\fR (default), \fBblowfish\fR, \fBtwofish\fR, or \fBserpent\fR.
.TP
.BI \-v SIZE
Create multi-volume archive (e.g. \fB-v10m\fR, \fB-v1440k\fR).
.TP
.BI \-x \ PATTERN
Exclude files matching pattern (@listfile supported).
.TP
.BI \-i \ PATTERN
Include only files matching pattern (@listfile supported).
.TP
.B \-so
Write extracted files to stdout.
.TP
.B \-ep
Store basenames only (strip directories).
.SH AUTHOR
Modern native C/C++ port by seb3773. Original FreeArc format by Bulat Ziganshin.
